{# One overlay for search and commands (UI wave G).
   ⌘K, ⌘P (Ctrl+K / Ctrl+P), "/" and the navbar trigger all open it.
   Empty query: commands (navigation, create, export, administration).
   Two or more characters: records and pages from app_api_search, plus the
   matching commands. Commands are gated by module and role here, so the
   palette offers nothing the user cannot open.
   Icons use Aurora fa-icon names. #}
